This patch applies <https://gmplib.org/repo/gmp/rev/8e7bb4ae7a18>, in order to
fix building with GCC 15. However, it also includes the regenerated build
system produced from 'autoreconf -fi'. This is because the patch requires the
build system to be regenerated, but the autotools packages aren't yet installed
when GMP is built (they get installed later on).

